---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = 'June 2026';
---

<Base
  pageLabel="Terms"
  description="Terms of use for the Altus KC website."
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap-narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">Last updated {updated}.</p>

      <h2>What this site is</h2>
      <p>
        This is the marketing site for Altus KC, a fractional revenue operating practice
        run by Mike Adkins in Kansas City. Nothing here is a contract, a guarantee of
        results, or professional advice for your specific situation. Engagements are
        governed by the separate written agreement we sign before any work begins.
      </p>

      <h2>The Revenue Engine Check</h2>
      <p>
        The diagnostic is a self-assessment tool. Its scores and recommendations are
        directional — a starting point for a conversation, not a substitute for a paid
        diagnostic or for your own judgment. Decisions you make from it are your own.
      </p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>
        Field Notes and case patterns on this site are mine. Client examples are
        anonymized unless a client has approved being named. You’re welcome to quote and
        link with attribution; please don’t republish wholesale.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:mike@altus-kc.com">mike@altus-kc.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-muted legal__note">
        This is a prototype document for review. Final terms should be confirmed before launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2.4rem; }
  .legal__note { font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
</style>
